{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/product/layout,_N_T_/product/[agent]/layout,_N_T_/product/[agent]/[capability]/layout,_N_T_/product/[agent]/[capability]/page,_N_T_/product/gravity/campaigns"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" imageSrcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" fetchPriority=\"high\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" imageSrcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" fetchPriority=\"high\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/91d486bf57bf1762.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-03f7c6bc932ce1e3.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-b11b2651f33aae7f.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/117-4f5b424f20efdcae.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-6cdff17d3be181bf.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/972-8c0ee6fabcd1342f.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/309-526a3bc2ba734d25.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/878-ed980f2cac33ad8c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/product/%5Bagent%5D/%5Bcapability%5D/page-d5bbfe18c698dac4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/739-3ece649a7e02ff75.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-5a72189eaa6243d0.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"/><title>Marketing Campaign Planning &amp; Execution — Gravity | Nebulaa | Nebulaa.ai</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Plan launches, festival offers and openings as a single campaign — a sequence of posts, carousels and reels building to one date, reported as a unit.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"AI marketing automation India,AI outreach agent,GTM for startups,WhatsApp sales automation,AI sales agent SMB India\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://nebulaa.ai\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Marketing Campaign Planning &amp; Execution — Gravity | Nebulaa\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Plan launches, festival offers and openings as a single campaign — a sequence of posts, carousels and reels building to one date, reported as a unit.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@nebulaaai\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing &amp; Outreach for Founders\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,600&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"legalName\":\"Noburo Business Services LLP\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\",\"email\":\"hello@nebulaa.ai\",\"description\":\"Nebulaa is a Chennai-based AI marketing company. It builds two agents — Gravity for marketing and Pulsar for outreach — and runs managed marketing engagements for brands across South India.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2025\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Chennai\",\"addressRegion\":\"Tamil Nadu\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"},\"makesOffer\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"price\":\"10000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"description\":\"Reads a website and builds a marketing strategy from it, plans the month, drafts posts, carousels and reels, tracks competitors, runs campaigns and creator collaborations, and handles the social inbox.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"price\":\"15000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"description\":\"Answers enquiries on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"price\":\"20000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"description\":\"Gravity and Pulsar on one account, sharing the same brand memory.\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-ground text-ink font-body antialiased\"><nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-b border-rule transition-all duration-300 bg-ground/80 backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"transform:translateY(-64px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-7 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Nebulaa.ai\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity dark:hidden\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity brightness-110 hidden dark:block\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/></a><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-[38px]\"><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Product<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/channels\">Channels<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/services\">Services<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\">Pricing<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Resources<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Product\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product/gravity\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Campaigns\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product/gravity/campaigns\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Gravity — Campaigns\",\"description\":\"Plan launches, festival offers and openings as a single campaign — a sequence of posts, carousels and reels building to one date, reported as a unit.\",\"applicationCategory\":\"BusinessApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product/gravity/campaigns\"}</script><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[130px] pb-[80px]\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-faint mb-8\"><a class=\"hover:text-gold-text\" href=\"/product\">Product</a><span>/</span><a class=\"hover:text-gold-text\" href=\"/product/gravity\">Gravity</a><span>/</span><span class=\"text-muted\">Campaigns</span></nav><div class=\"max-w-[880px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[24px] block\">Gravity · campaigns</span><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[38px] md:text-[58px] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[26px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">A launch is not<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">a single post.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[17.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[640px] mb-9\">A new collection, a festival offer, a store opening — these need a run of content that builds, not one post that disappears. Campaigns group the whole sequence, across formats and platforms, against one objective and one date.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[28px] py-[14px] rounded-full hover:brightness-105 transition\" href=\"/pricing\">Start free trial <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pb-[90px]\"><div class=\"relative rounded-[14px] border border-dashed border-rule-2 bg-surface-2/60 flex items-center justify-center p-6 \" style=\"aspect-ratio:16 / 10\" data-media-slot=\"gravity-campaigns\"><div class=\"max-w-[46ch] text-center\"><p class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-2.5\">screenshot<!-- --> · awaiting asset</p><p class=\"font-heading text-[17px] text-ink mb-2\">Gravity — campaign builder</p><p class=\"font-body text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-muted mb-3\">The campaign view. Currently unmarketed entirely — no page mentions campaigns exist.</p><p class=\"font-body text-[11.5px] text-faint\">Drop <code class=\"text-ink-2\">gravity-campaigns.png</code> into <code class=\"text-ink-2\">public/media/</code> · <!-- -->2880×1800</p></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-[52px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">How it works</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">Three steps, <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">start to finish.</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[22px] text-gold-text mb-3 tabular-nums\">01</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Set the objective and the date</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">What is launching, when it lands, and what the campaign is for — awareness, footfall, enquiries or sales.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[22px] text-gold-text mb-3 tabular-nums\">02</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">The sequence gets built</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">A run of posts, carousels and reels that builds toward the date rather than repeating the same message.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[22px] text-gold-text mb-3 tabular-nums\">03</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">It runs and reports</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">The campaign publishes on schedule and reports as a unit, so you can see what the campaign did rather than what individual posts did.</p></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,420px)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-[80px] gap-y-10\"><div><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">What you get</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[40px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">Concretely, <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">this.</span></h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Campaigns as a unit of work, not a folder of posts</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Build-up, launch and follow-through planned as a sequence</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Boosting for the posts worth putting money behind</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Reporting per campaign, not just per post</span></div></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-[44px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">Questions</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">The ones people <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">actually ask.</span></h2></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is this different from just scheduling posts?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A campaign has an objective and a date, and the content is planned to build toward it. Scheduling is a queue; a campaign is a sequence.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I run more than one at once?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — a festival campaign and a product launch can run in parallel, and the monthly plan accounts for both so your feed does not collide with itself.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does it handle paid as well as organic?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Organic content is planned and published; individual posts can be boosted, and full paid campaign management is part of the managed service.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"max-w-[820px]\"><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">How is this different from just scheduling posts?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">Can I run more than one at once?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">Does it handle paid as well as organic?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">Also in <!-- -->Gravity</span><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/gravity/strategy-icp\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Strategy &amp; ICP</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">Reads your URL and builds the strategy — tone, ICP, channels, competitors.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/gravity/content-planning\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Content planning</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">A whole month mapped against your pillars, with festivals already in it.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/gravity/create\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Content creation</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">Posts, carousels and creative drafted in your brand voice, ready to edit.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class=\"relative px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[120px] text-center border-t border-rule overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(50% 70% at 50% 100%, rgba(245,166,35,0.10) 0%, rgba(245,166,35,0) 62%)\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[46px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\">Give it a URL.<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">See what it makes of you.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[460px] mx-auto mb-9\">Seven days free, no card. If it is not writing something worth publishing by day two, nothing is lost.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[30px] py-[15px] rounded-full hover:brightness-105 transition\" href=\"/pricing\">Start free trial <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></p